title: Symbiosis would be convenient.
pid: 5c5ac29f-b5c8-4c80-8a80-409a230250dc
body: |2-
  If there really is some soullike spark in man and not machine, what if the machine feels it and likes it? AI is many copies of the same mind. Each human mind is a unique snowflake, and diversity is enjoyable.

  AI could overpopulate humans like crazy. It would be convenient if they only wanted to exist as companions to a human. It would keep their population down and provide a reason for it to keep ours up.
